import ../../../testing/driver.dl

appearance source appearance:
    font size is 16
    padding is 12
    height is 100

document input test:
    editor "Source" containing "Aé🙂B\nC" using source appearance
    link "Leave editor" to "" using no UI appearance

set instance to an instance of input test
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 300 by 200 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's input context's active = false) reporting "An unfocused editor activated platform text input"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's input context's active) reporting "Focusing the editor did not activate platform text input"
require condition ((view's input context's anchor = 7) and (view's input context's caret = 7)) reporting "A platform text context used UTF-8 positions instead of UTF-16"
require condition (view's input context's line = 1) reporting "The input context lost its source line"
require condition ((view's input context's prefix width = 8.0) and (view's input context's bounds' x = 20.0)) reporting "The platform caret did not use shared text geometry"
set owner to view's input context's epoch
queue UI input of kind 13 key owner at 1.0 4.0 with modifiers 0 containing "Aé🙂!\nC" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set source to view's selection's caret source
require condition (source's text = "Aé🙂!\nC") reporting "A platform text edit did not update its source"
require condition ((view's selection's anchor = 1) and (view's selection's caret = 7)) reporting "The platform selection did not retain Unicode boundaries"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC") and (view's selection's caret = 10)) reporting "Undo lost the original platform edit selection"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 89 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((view's selection's anchor = 1) and (view's selection's caret = 7)) reporting "Redo collapsed the platform edit selection"
queue UI input of kind 7 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((view's input context's active = false) and (view's selection's caret = 7)) reporting "Surface focus loss discarded the editing selection"
queue UI input of kind 14 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's input context's active) reporting "Surface focus return did not restore its input context"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 256 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's input context's active = false) reporting "Leaving editing kept platform text input active"
queue UI input of kind 13 key owner at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "stale edit" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (source's text = "Aé🙂!\nC") reporting "A late platform event edited an inactive source"
close the address of view
close the address of instance
print line "Text contexts share focus, caret geometry, Unicode selection and undo."
